  m_text: "JOGO CRIADO POR\n\n\nClara Nelson\nDaniel Amaral\nIvan Marinho\nJoao Vitor
    Lima\nJoao Pedro Santos\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\nVitor Cesar\n\n\nORIENTADOR\nLuis
    Felipe Matsya\n\n\nPROFESSORES-AUXILIO\nRoque Anderson Saldanha\nJoao Paulo de
    Lima Silva\nMarcos Arrais e Silva\n\n\nGERENTE\nJoao Vitor Lima\n\n\nARTE 2D\nMaria
    Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nARTE 3D\nClara Nelson\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nTEXTURAS\nClara
    Nelson\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nANIMACOES\nClara Nelson\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nPROGRAMACAO\nJoao
    Vitor Lima\nVitor Cesar\nDaniel Amaral\nIvan Marinho\n\n\nUNITY DEVELOPERS\nJoao
    Vitor Lima\nVItor Cesar\n\n\nUI/UX DESIGN\nIvan Marinho\n\n\nDESIGN INTERFACES\nIvan
    Marinho\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nAUDIO\nDaniel Amaral\n\n\nGAME/LEVEL DESIGN\nClara
    Nelson\nDaniel Amaral\nIvan Marinho\nJoao Vitor Lima\nJoao Pedro Santos\nMaria
    Eduarda Cezar\nVitor Cesar\n\n\nVISUAL EFFECTS\nClara Nelson\nMaria Eduarda Cezar\n\n\nCREDITOS/CONTEUDOS\nSons
    do freesound.org\n\nBoing-SFX.mp3 - elfstonepress\n\nGame Jump Sound - Boing 
    - el_boss\n\nAfternoon Woods in October - Midwest US (loop) - NickTayloe\n\n
